DESCRIPTION:SideQuest LA\n\nTwo powerhouse Louisiana musicians\, one shared
  love of great music. SideQuest LA brings together vocalist\, songwriter\,
  and drummer Gino V. and guitarist\, vocalist\, and songwriter Zach Edward
 s for a musical collaboration that refuses to stay in one lane.\n\nRooted 
 in the sounds of South Louisiana but reaching well beyond its musical bord
 ers\, SideQuest blends soul\, blues\, R&B\, funk\, hip-hop\, and good old-
 fashioned rock and roll. The duo combines original songwriting with unexpe
 cted takes on some of their favorite songs\, creating a show that is as ve
 rsatile as it is entertaining.\n\nGino V.\, born and raised in Delcambre\,
  Louisiana\, is a seasoned musician known for his commanding vocals\, deep
  grooves\, and dynamic musicianship. He has performed with some of Acadian
 a's respected artists and notably played drums for Louisiana music legend 
 Wayne Toups.\n\nZach Edwards adds his own distinctive guitar work\, vocals
 \, and songwriting to the mix\, bringing together the blues\, rock\, and r
 oots influences that make the SideQuest sound uniquely their own.\n\nWheth
 er delivering soulful originals\, stretching out on a blues-rock groove\, 
 or putting their own spin on familiar favorites\, SideQuest LA brings plen
 ty of musical firepower and personality to the stage.\n\nExpect big groove
 s\, soulful vocals\, killer guitar work\, and a little bit of everything. 
 SideQuest is anything but an ordinary night of live music.\n\nhttps://even
 ts.timely.fun/kw4jncf1/event/78504058/20261127230000
